---
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent
    participant O as OCE
    participant G as OpenShell gateway<br/>embedded issuer
    participant S as OpenShell<br/>sender
    participant H as GitHub
    Note over O,G: 1 · Approve and provision
    O->>G: Configure this Agent’s grant
    G->>H: Sign with App key and request token
    H-->>G: Scoped installation token
    G->>S: Deliver token
    Note over A,H: 2 · Send to an approved repository
    A->>S: Git request
    S->>O: Check Agent, repository and operation
    O-->>S: Allow
    S->>H: Send with token
    Note over A,H: 3 · OCE withdraws this Agent’s Git grant
    A->>S: Next Git request
    S->>O: Check again
    O-->>S: Deny
    S-->>A: Access denied
